Package: revdeprunner
Type: Package
Title: Reusable Reverse-Dependency Check Infrastructure
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("James", "Melville", email = "jlmelville@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Reproducible, incremental R package reverse-dependency checks. It
    prepares reusable binary artifacts once, separates run-local state, reports
    dependency failures before comparisons begin, and drives guarded stock
    reverse-dependency checks from an exact dependency plan.
